---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy notice" description="Information about Mew & Maple website features and technical requests.">
  <section class="container prose-page">

    <h1>Privacy notice</h1>
    <p>Mew &amp; Maple is an independent editorial website operated by SamiGLab (<a href="mailto:samigrowlab@gmail.com">samigrowlab@gmail.com</a>). This notice explains what technical information is handled when you visit the site or contact us by email.</p>

    <h2>Current website features</h2>
    <p>This website contains no Google Analytics, advertising pixels, mailing-list signup forms or active affiliate tracking scripts. On-site article search uses a static JSON file downloaded by your browser and does not send search queries to an application server.</p>

    <h2>Hosting and technical requests</h2>
    <p>The primary website at <code>mewandmaple.com</code> is served as a static site through GitHub Pages, with a separate technical preview environment hosted on Cloudflare Workers Static Assets (<code>mew-maple.samiayten-hu.workers.dev</code>). Like most websites, the underlying hosting and network providers process standard request metadata—such as IP address, user-agent and requested URL—as necessary to deliver pages, maintain security and diagnose technical faults under their respective service terms.</p>

    <h2>Cookies and third parties</h2>
    <p>We do not set analytics or advertising cookies, and fonts are served without third-party font requests. Infrastructure providers may apply standard security and network controls when serving requests.</p>

    <h2>Your rights and contact</h2>
    <p>Depending on your location, you may have rights to request access to, correction of or deletion of personal data we hold (such as email correspondence). For privacy questions or requests, email <a href="mailto:samigrowlab@gmail.com">samigrowlab@gmail.com</a> and include only the details needed to handle your inquiry.</p>

    <h2>Email correspondence</h2><p>If you email us, your message and email address are processed by your email provider and the receiving email provider, Gmail, to deliver and handle the correspondence. We do not use a website contact form or mailing-list signup.</p>
    <h2>Future changes</h2>
    <p>Analytics, commerce, newsletter subscriptions, affiliate programs or personalized features are not currently enabled. If any of these are introduced later, this notice and any required consent controls will be updated before that processing begins.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
